    {
     "who": "genzo",
     "memory": true,
     "shot": "sky",
     "text": "It was a wonderful night, the kind of night that can only happen when we are young, dear reader."
    },
    {
     "who": "genzo",
     "memory": true,
     "shot": "sky",
     "text": "The sky was so full of stars, so bright, that looking up at it you had to ask yourself: can angry, unhappy people really live under a sky like this?"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "thought": true,
     "shot": "sky",
     "text": "My grandfather read me that sentence so many times I could say it before I could spell it."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "thought": true,
     "shot": "sky",
     "text": "He said every Russian novel worth reading starts on a night like this one."
    },
    {
     "dur": 3.5,
     "insert": {
      "kind": "photo"
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "thought": true,
