  {
   "type": "scene",
   "id": "laundry-1",
   "lines": [
    {
     "dur": 3.0,
     "shot": "wide",
     "sfx": "page"
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.5,
     "shot": "close:itsuki"
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.0,
     "shot": "wide",
     "sfx": "bell"
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.5,
     "shot": "wide",
     "sfx": "buzzer",
     "sfxAt": 0.6,
     "cs": {
      "mio": {
       "slot": "benchL",
       "prop": "book",
       "emo": "neutral"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.0,
     "shot": "two",
     "react": {
      "mio": "neutral"
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "thought": true,
     "look": "book",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "Gramps's copy. Third time this summer. I keep thinking if I read it enough, his notes will start saying new things."
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.0,
     "shot": "two",
     "sfx": "page"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "thought": true,
     "emo": "surprised",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "Wait. Green cover. That's..."
    },
    {
     "dur": 3.5,
     "insert": {
      "kind": "cover",
      "title": "White Nights",
      "author": "F. M. Dostoevsky",
      "color": "#3f6a4a",
      "caption": "The man at the other end of the bench."
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "thought": true,
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "He's reading White Nights. In a coin laundry. On a Thursday."
    },
    {
     "dur": 1.5,
     "shot": "two"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "smile",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "Excuse me."
    },
    {
     "dur": 1.2,
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "react": {
      "itsuki": {
       "emo": "surprised",
       "look": "other"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "tease",
     "text": "You're reading it wrong."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "surprised",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "Sorry?"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "grin",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "White Nights. You're meant to read it outside. At night. Ideally on a bridge."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "blush",
     "look": "down",
     "text": "It's... a coin laundry."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "tease",
     "text": "Exactly. Very wrong. And you're slouching exactly like the Dreamer, which is a bit much."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "thought": true,
     "emo": "flustered",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "Who is this?"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "shy",
     "look": "down",
     "text": "Sorry. That was rude. My grandfather used to say that. \"You're reading it wrong.\" He said it about everything."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "smile",
     "text": "Menus. Train timetables. My report cards."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "neutral",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "...Was he a teacher?"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "soft",
     "text": "A translator. Russian literature. He read to me on the veranda every summer, with a mosquito coil going, doing all the voices. His Nastenka was terrible. Very high. Very Russian."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "smile",
     "look": "book",
     "text": "This one was his."
    },
    {
     "dur": 6.0,
     "insert": {
      "kind": "book",
      "title": "White Nights",
      "text": "It was a wonderful night, the kind of night that can only happen when we are young, dear reader.",
      "underline": 2,
      "note": "Read this one\nunder the stars, Mio.\nNot under a lamp.\n— G.",
      "noteBy": "genzo"
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "soft",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "...Oh. I'm sorry."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "smile",
     "text": "Don't be. He'd love this. A stranger reading it in public. He'd have come over and corrected your posture."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "shy",
     "text": "Which translation is yours?"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "thought": true,
     "emo": "surprised",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "He asked a question."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "grin",
     "text": "His own. He never published it. It's all in pencil, in the margins. Which one's yours?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "book",
     "text": "The green one."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "tease",
     "text": "The green one is fine. Gramps called it \"competent.\" From him, that was practically a medal."
    },
    {
     "dur": 1.5,
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "react": {
      "itsuki": "smile"
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "thought": true,
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "He almost smiled. Like someone who has forgotten where he put his smile and just found it in a coat pocket."
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.5,
     "shot": "wide",
     "sfx": "page"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "How far are you?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "book",
     "text": "The second night."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "text": "So she's just told him about her grandmother and the pin."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "act": "nod",
     "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "soft",
     "look": "front",
     "shot": "mcu:mio",
     "text": "Her grandmother is blind, so she pins Nastenka's dress to her own dress with a safety pin. For years. So she can't run off."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "When I was little, I thought that was the saddest thing in the book."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "...And now?"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "Now I think the saddest thing in the book is him. The Dreamer. Eight years in the city and he doesn't know a single person."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "sad",
     "text": "He knows the houses, though. He says good morning to the buildings. One of them got painted yellow and he grieved like it was a friend."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "down",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "...The buildings don't mind."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "surprised",
     "text": "What?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "flustered",
     "act": "hide",
     "text": "Nothing."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "grin",
     "act": "lean",
     "text": "No, no. Say it again."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "shy",
     "look": "down",
     "text": "Buildings are... good company. They're there every morning. They don't expect anything from you."
    },
    {
     "dur": 1.5,
     "shot": "two",
     "react": {
      "mio": "tease"
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "In the book, she asks him for his history. Remember? \"Tell me your history.\" And he says he hasn't got one."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "book",
     "text": "\"I have no history.\""
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "tease",
     "act": "lean",
     "text": "So what's yours?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "blush",
     "look": "down",
     "text": "...I haven't got one."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "grin",
     "text": "Everybody has one."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "shy",
     "look": "front",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "Mine is very short. Boy reads books. Boy grows up. Boy reads books in a laundry."
    },
    {
     "dur": 1.2,
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "react": {
      "mio": {
       "emo": "laugh",
       "act": "laugh"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "tease",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "Mr. Dreamer."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "flustered",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "I'm not..."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "tease",
     "act": "point",
     "text": "You are reading White Nights, alone, in a coin laundry, at ten thirty on a Thursday night. That's practically a confession."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "blush",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "You're... also here."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "grin",
     "text": "I'm doing laundry. You're doing literature at the laundry. Different crime."
    },
    {
     "dur": 3.0,
     "shot": "wide",
     "sfx": "meow",
     "sfxAt": 1
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.0,
     "shot": "insert:cat",
     "sfx": "purr",
     "cat": {
      "slot": "cat_dryer",
      "pose": "sit"
     },
     "insert": {
      "kind": "cat",
      "pose": "sit"
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "smile",
     "look": "up",
     "text": "Oh. You're awake. That's Fyodor."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "surprised",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "The cat?"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "tease",
     "text": "I named him just now. He looks like a man with gambling debts."
    },
    {
     "dur": 1.2,
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "react": {
      "itsuki": {
       "emo": "laugh",
       "act": "laugh"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "thought": true,
     "emo": "surprised",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "He laughed. It sounded rusty. Like a gate nobody has opened in a long time."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "shy",
     "look": "down",
     "text": "...Dostoevsky really did have gambling debts."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "grin",
     "text": "I know. That's why it's funny."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "Fedya, then. That's what Russians would call a Fyodor at home."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "warm",
     "text": "Fedya. Okay. Fedya when he's good, Fyodor Mikhailovich when he's on the counter."
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.5,
     "shot": "wide"
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.0,
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "react": {
      "itsuki": {
       "look": "up"
      }
     },
     "cat": {
      "slot": "cat_dryer",
      "pose": "sleep"
     }
    },
    {
     "dur": 3.5,
     "insert": {
      "kind": "sign",
      "fixed": false
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "two",
     "text": "You keep looking at that sign."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "blush",
     "look": "down",
     "text": "Sorry."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "smile",
     "text": "\"Dryer, ten minuts.\" It's been like that for years. I think it's cute. Like little tiny minutes."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "serious",
     "look": "up",
     "text": "It's wrong."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "laugh",
     "text": "Are you an English teacher?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "shy",
     "look": "down",
     "text": "Proofreader."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "grin",
     "act": "laugh",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "Of course you are. Of course the man reading Dostoevsky in the laundry fixes other people's spelling for a living."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "blush",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "I don't fix it. I just... notice it."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "soft",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "That's what the Dreamer does too, isn't it. Notices everything. Touches nothing."
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.5,
     "shot": "two",
     "react": {
      "itsuki": {
       "emo": "sad",
       "look": "down"
      }
     }
    }
   ],
