  },
  {
   "type": "scene",
   "id": "laundry-2",
   "lines": [
    {
     "dur": 2.5,
     "shot": "wide"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "thinking",
     "look": "up",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "Can I ask you something, Mr. Dreamer?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "...You will anyway."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "grin",
     "text": "Correct. The ending. The last line. Do you believe it?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "book",
     "text": "I haven't read the ending yet."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "surprised",
     "text": "You've never read it?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "shy",
     "look": "down",
     "text": "I have. Eleven times. I just haven't read it tonight."
    },
    {
     "dur": 1.5,
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "react": {
      "mio": {
       "emo": "laugh",
       "act": "laugh"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "tease",
     "text": "Eleven. That's not reading, that's a relationship."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "serious",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "Okay. The ending. She chooses the lodger. The man she was waiting for comes back, and she runs to him, right in front of the Dreamer. And the next morning she sends a letter, and he sits in his room and says..."
    },
    {
     "dur": 7.0,
     "insert": {
      "kind": "book",
      "title": "White Nights",
      "text": "My God, a whole moment of bliss!",
      "right": "Is that really too little, even for the whole of a man's life?",
      "underline": 1,
      "note": "Yes.\n— G. (1971)\n\nNo.\n— G. (2019)",
      "noteBy": "genzo"
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "soft",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "Gramps wrote \"yes\" in nineteen seventy-one. And then, years later, under it, \"no.\" In different pencil."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "surprised",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "He changed his mind."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "sad",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "He changed his mind and never told me why. I found it in April, after."
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.0,
     "shot": "two"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "I think it's not enough. One moment? For a whole life? That's the consolation prize. That's what you tell yourself when you lost."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "thinking",
     "look": "front",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "...Or it's the opposite."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "front",
     "shot": "mcu:itsuki",
     "text": "Most people never get the moment at all. They don't even notice when it's happening. He noticed. For four nights he was completely awake."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "soft",
     "look": "front",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "He knew it was ending while it was still happening, and he didn't look away. I think that's the bravest thing anybody does in the book."
    },
    {
     "dur": 1.5,
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "react": {
      "mio": "surprised"
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "thought": true,
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "Oh. He can talk. He just needs a book to stand behind."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "blush",
     "act": "hide",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "Sorry. That was a lot."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "smile",
     "shot": "two",
     "text": "No. It was good. You sounded like someone else for a second."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "shy",
     "look": "down",
     "text": "...Someone else?"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "tease",
     "text": "Someone who says more than four words."
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.0,
     "shot": "wide",
     "sfx": "page"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "Have you had one? A moment like that?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "down",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "...Once."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "And?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "sad",
     "look": "away",
     "text": "It was enough to live on for a long time."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "soft",
     "text": "Is it still?"
    },
    {
     "dur": 3.0,
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "react": {
      "itsuki": {
       "look": "down"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "down",
     "text": "It was a long time ago."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "thought": true,
     "emo": "sad",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "That's not an answer. That's a door closing very politely."
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.0,
     "shot": "two"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "soft",
     "look": "front",
     "shot": "mcu:mio",
     "text": "I'll tell you mine, then. To be fair."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "soft",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "Last summer, Gramps read me White Nights on the veranda. One night per evening. Four evenings. He was already sick, but he wouldn't skip."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "sad",
     "look": "down",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "On the fourth evening he fell asleep before the end. So I read him the morning. Out loud. It's the only time I ever read to him."
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.5,
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "react": {
      "itsuki": {
       "emo": "sad",
       "look": "other"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "smile",
     "look": "front",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "That's mine. It's enough to live on for a while."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "soft",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "...Thank you for telling me."
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.5,
     "shot": "two"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "Everyone hates Nastenka, you know. People say she uses him. She cries on him, she makes him help with her letter, then she runs off with the other guy."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "You don't hate her."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "serious",
     "text": "She's been pinned to a blind old woman for years. The one person who was ever kind to her left her alone for a whole year. She's allowed to be selfish for one night."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "She's seventeen. She doesn't know yet that you can hurt someone just by being happy in front of them."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "...She's seventeen?"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "smile",
     "text": "Seventeen. Same as me."
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.0,
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "react": {
      "itsuki": {
       "emo": "serious",
       "look": "front"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "serious",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "...It's late. You should be home."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "pout",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "The laundry's open twenty-four hours. That's the whole point of it. So people like us have somewhere to be."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "People like us?"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "smile",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "People whose washing machines are broken."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "down",
     "text": "...Mine broke three years ago."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "surprised",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "Three years? And you just never fixed it?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "shy",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "It's on a list."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "tease",
     "text": "What else is on the list?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "flustered",
     "act": "hide",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "...It's a long list."
    },
    {
     "dur": 1.5,
     "shot": "two",
     "react": {
      "mio": {
       "emo": "laugh",
       "act": "laugh"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "thought": true,
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "That isn't what she meant, either. About the broken machines."
    },
    {
     "dur": 3.0,
     "shot": "wide",
     "sfx": "buzzer"
    }
   ],
   "chars": {
