  {
   "type": "scene",
   "id": "laundry-3",
   "lines": [
    {
     "dur": 2.0,
     "shot": "wide"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "down",
     "shot": "mcu:mio",
     "text": "These aren't mine, by the way. My stepfather's shirts. He's a nice man. He irons his socks."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "...That's very thorough."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "laugh",
     "text": "Isn't it? We moved into his house in May. My mum's having a baby in winter. Everything's very new and very clean and very... ironed."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "smile",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "So on Thursdays I do the laundry. The dryer at home is broken. It's very convenient that it's broken."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "soft",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "...Convenient."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "Don't do that."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "surprised",
     "text": "Do what?"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "tease",
     "text": "Notice things. It's my job tonight. You're the one who's supposed to be embarrassing."
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.5,
     "shot": "two",
     "sfx": "page"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "front",
     "text": "Dostoevsky wrote White Nights when he was twenty-six, you know. Before anything bad happened to him. Gramps said that's why it's so gentle. It's the last thing he wrote before the world got its hands on him."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "front",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "A year later, they arrested him."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "other",
     "text": "You know that?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "shy",
     "look": "down",
     "text": "I know a lot of useless things about him."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "warm",
     "text": "It isn't useless. It's just homeless. It needs someone to tell it to."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "...Is that why you talk to strangers in laundries?"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "surprised",
     "shot": "close:mio",
     "text": "Was that a joke? Mr. Dreamer, was that a joke?"
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "blush",
     "act": "hide",
     "text": "No."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "grin",
     "text": "It was. It was a small, dry joke. I'm writing it down."
    },
    {
     "dur": 3.0,
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "react": {
      "itsuki": {
       "emo": "soft",
       "look": "other"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.0,
     "shot": "wide",
     "sfx": "steps",
     "cs": {
      "mio": {
       "slot": "door"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "mcu:mio",
     "text": "The Dreamer gets four nights, you know. Four nights and one morning. That's all."
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "tease",
     "text": "Let's see how many you get."
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "surprised",
     "look": "other",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "...What?"
    },
    {
     "who": "mio",
     "emo": "grin",
     "text": "Same time next Thursday, Mr. Dreamer?"
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.5,
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "react": {
      "itsuki": {
       "emo": "blush",
       "look": "down"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "dur": 2.5,
     "shot": "wide",
     "sfx": "bell",
     "cs": {
      "mio": {
       "slot": "none"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "dur": 3.0,
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "react": {
      "itsuki": {
       "emo": "soft",
       "look": "front"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "who": "itsuki",
     "emo": "soft",
     "look": "front",
     "shot": "close:itsuki",
     "text": "...Yes."
    },
    {
     "dur": 4.0,
     "shot": "wide"
    }
   ],
   "chars": {
    "itsuki": {
     "slot": "benchR",
